    "brand": "Kodiak",
    "badge": "Best Flavored Mix",
    "category": "Whole-grain chocolate protein pancake mix",
    "description": "Kodiak's Dark Chocolate Power Cakes use the same whole-grain base as the Buttermilk mix with cocoa and chocolate added. Retailer listings at the time of writing put it at about 14 g of protein per serving with water, a gram or so below Buttermilk, and some flavored Kodiak boxes run lower still (Pumpkin is listed around 13 g). It is the flavored box buyers rate most consistently, and it works well as waffles or a quick chocolate mug cake. Expect a little more sugar than in the plain mix.",
