            Kodiak Power Cakes Buttermilk is the protein pancake mix to buy if you want one box that does everything reasonably well: whole grains, about 14 to 15 g of protein with water, and a texture buyers like. FlapJacked wins on protein per serving, Birch Benders on convenience and Krusteaz on price. Whichever you pick, compare the water-only numbers, not the milk-and-egg headline.
